{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港股缺乏方向，曾經失守兩萬四關口。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">個別人工智能概念股繼續受壓，華虹宏力跌近百分之6。中芯跌百分之3。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">被大行降低目標價的百度，下跌百分之8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-14T05:39:03.865713+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":71,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}